      "party": "Republican Party",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Michael Baumgartner is the incumbent U.S. Representative for Washington's 5th Congressional District, first elected in 2024. He previously served as Spokane County Treasurer (2019-2025) and as a Washington State Senator (2011-2019), and was the Republican nominee for U.S. Senate in 2012. Baumgartner holds degrees from Washington State University and Harvard's Kennedy School and worked as a civilian contractor in Iraq and Afghanistan.",
